{"3196270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fishing Shop Simulator", "steam_appid": 3196270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/804f61f2c843cef5d0dcf28e5b2c67e1.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/804f61f2c843cef5d0dcf28e5b2c67e1.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/804f61f2c843cef5d0dcf28e5b2c67e1.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fishing shopkeeper where you start off in a pile of rubble in this mysterious world, in the hopes of rebuilding and making a large successful shop and fish collection.  As you sell fish and build up your personal collection, a town begins growing around you and begins to evolve and level up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The game is still in alpha development</i></strong> - I plan on posting updates on my steams news/update pages, Discord and Youtube!<br> <br>I'm a single developer making this while working full time, so this comes out of pure enjoyment of simulator and tycoon games.  I also will emphasize that I'm going to be slow with progress at times because I need to manage my full time job and life as well.  I won't promise a perfect or super polished game - But I can promise I'm passionate and want to make a fun game for people to enjoy.  This is the first time I'm attempting at making my own full game so I appreciate the patience and support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rare &amp; Giga Catches</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/a93876742d5c26fd1d7fb302a52bfaa9.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/a93876742d5c26fd1d7fb302a52bfaa9.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/a93876742d5c26fd1d7fb302a52bfaa9.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In rare scenarios you'll get rare giga sized catches, as well as Holographic/Foils that are worth a lot of money (I'm a big fan of trading card games, so snuck in foils!); However they could also be really handy to make your store more attractive for customers, as display pieces.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collecting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/dcb4a5786f570fc20b824ab3532a8770.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/dcb4a5786f570fc20b824ab3532a8770.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/dcb4a5786f570fc20b824ab3532a8770.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A part of the games mechanic is collecting and displaying some of your catches - Every unique fish on display improves your stores collection bonus.  I want to have TONS of unique fish to find and catch in the future!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the main gameplay themes of the game is to collect all the unique fish in the world!  I will continue to keep adding in more types of fish into the game</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grading</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/bab52ccfb857ac351a61a830dc0c4796.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/bab52ccfb857ac351a61a830dc0c4796.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/bab52ccfb857ac351a61a830dc0c4796.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Later on in the game, a grader NPC opens up shop where you can then begin getting your fish graded!  This is heavily inspired by Trading Card Games where you get cards graded</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This can enhance OR decrease the value of the fish... depending on its quality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graded fish can be mounted on walls, and stacked on top of eachother on displays so you can amass a bigger collection in a smaller space</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tech Tree</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/7497c514575a3cc031cce82942b638bf.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/7497c514575a3cc031cce82942b638bf.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/7497c514575a3cc031cce82942b638bf.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bait</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk Vs Reward: Bait will cost a upfront amount, but gives you a chance at catching better fish!  Some bait will be for specific fish in regions, while other bait just overall increases your chances.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/3c25905b18206ab805f3c17d26a46acc.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/3c25905b18206ab805f3c17d26a46acc.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/3c25905b18206ab805f3c17d26a46acc.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ruins of the 'Old World' and find new fishing spots!  I have a lot of ideas planned for future biomes in this strange post-apocalyptic world.  I want this world to feel  fun to explore and discover!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/0ed345882bc62ddbbaa85a20b563b86c.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/0ed345882bc62ddbbaa85a20b563b86c.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/0ed345882bc62ddbbaa85a20b563b86c.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to make your shop appealing to the world's wanderers so they move into the area and bring more wealth to afford those big hitters you catch</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Town Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/921ea0f1849f437bf1a145c8266ab38e.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/921ea0f1849f437bf1a145c8266ab38e.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/921ea0f1849f437bf1a145c8266ab38e.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/302bdc56f1f248908a1a413f12df04e8.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/302bdc56f1f248908a1a413f12df04e8.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/302bdc56f1f248908a1a413f12df04e8.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you repair and upgrade your shop, others will begin settling into the area as well and begin building, I hope this will make it visually rewarding and exciting to see the area change over time!  You will unlock possible NPC's to interact with in the future here.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rebuilding &amp; Upgrading</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/5c2d521803c225c27032ffa487ec089c.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/5c2d521803c225c27032ffa487ec089c.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/5c2d521803c225c27032ffa487ec089c.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to make your shop appealing to the world's wanderers.  As you keep upgrading your store, you'll get more floor space and new props/technology to build your store with!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weather</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/1977cae14f48dcdcf396eed6ffdbdf62.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/1977cae14f48dcdcf396eed6ffdbdf62.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/1977cae14f48dcdcf396eed6ffdbdf62.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When rainy days happen, different fish become available that you can't find in clear weather!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/7e7581a890dabc65076417111b491313.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/7e7581a890dabc65076417111b491313.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/7e7581a890dabc65076417111b491313.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your decorations, furniture, and displays the way you want to!  I want to get a nice variety of content for you to make your store layouts interesting and unique.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Taxes - The Government</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/9d4f60b383bc1f8e76929f33564618a6.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/9d4f60b383bc1f8e76929f33564618a6.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/9d4f60b383bc1f8e76929f33564618a6.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even in the apocalypse you can't escape the tax man - The government will fly near your shop every few days to collect payment for helping you rebuild - They want their cut!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decorating</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > I want to actually reward players for decorating, instead of it just being purely for looks!  I haven't figured out exactly what 'decor' bonus will give yet, but I'll keep you posted.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dog</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/7cd315113c4ccd5d69150c24d2b6e3b2.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/7cd315113c4ccd5d69150c24d2b6e3b2.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/7cd315113c4ccd5d69150c24d2b6e3b2.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your dog fed and happy!  I want to make the dog mechanic more interesting in the future (Including maybe choosing a different starter pet).  It will be a fun little companion on your journey across this odd world.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Achievements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/966ef4e4b48190edfd7ced10954ff280.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/966ef4e4b48190edfd7ced10954ff280.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/966ef4e4b48190edfd7ced10954ff280.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > I'd love to have a way for you to keep track of all the fish you've discovered, how many you've caught and the biggest weight you've caught!  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/804f61f2c843cef5d0dcf28e5b2c67e1.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/804f61f2c843cef5d0dcf28e5b2c67e1.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/804f61f2c843cef5d0dcf28e5b2c67e1.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fishing shopkeeper where you start off in a pile of rubble in this mysterious world, in the hopes of rebuilding and making a large successful shop and fish collection.  As you sell fish and build up your personal collection, a town begins growing around you and begins to evolve and level up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The game is still in alpha development</i></strong> - I plan on posting updates on my steams news/update pages, Discord and Youtube!<br> <br>I'm a single developer making this while working full time, so this comes out of pure enjoyment of simulator and tycoon games.  I also will emphasize that I'm going to be slow with progress at times because I need to manage my full time job and life as well.  I won't promise a perfect or super polished game - But I can promise I'm passionate and want to make a fun game for people to enjoy.  This is the first time I'm attempting at making my own full game so I appreciate the patience and support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rare &amp; Giga Catches</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/a93876742d5c26fd1d7fb302a52bfaa9.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/a93876742d5c26fd1d7fb302a52bfaa9.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/a93876742d5c26fd1d7fb302a52bfaa9.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In rare scenarios you'll get rare giga sized catches, as well as Holographic/Foils that are worth a lot of money (I'm a big fan of trading card games, so snuck in foils!); However they could also be really handy to make your store more attractive for customers, as display pieces.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collecting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/dcb4a5786f570fc20b824ab3532a8770.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/dcb4a5786f570fc20b824ab3532a8770.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/dcb4a5786f570fc20b824ab3532a8770.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A part of the games mechanic is collecting and displaying some of your catches - Every unique fish on display improves your stores collection bonus.  I want to have TONS of unique fish to find and catch in the future!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the main gameplay themes of the game is to collect all the unique fish in the world!  I will continue to keep adding in more types of fish into the game</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grading</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/bab52ccfb857ac351a61a830dc0c4796.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/bab52ccfb857ac351a61a830dc0c4796.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/bab52ccfb857ac351a61a830dc0c4796.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Later on in the game, a grader NPC opens up shop where you can then begin getting your fish graded!  This is heavily inspired by Trading Card Games where you get cards graded</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This can enhance OR decrease the value of the fish... depending on its quality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graded fish can be mounted on walls, and stacked on top of eachother on displays so you can amass a bigger collection in a smaller space</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tech Tree</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/7497c514575a3cc031cce82942b638bf.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/7497c514575a3cc031cce82942b638bf.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/7497c514575a3cc031cce82942b638bf.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bait</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk Vs Reward: Bait will cost a upfront amount, but gives you a chance at catching better fish!  Some bait will be for specific fish in regions, while other bait just overall increases your chances.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/3c25905b18206ab805f3c17d26a46acc.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/3c25905b18206ab805f3c17d26a46acc.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/3c25905b18206ab805f3c17d26a46acc.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ruins of the 'Old World' and find new fishing spots!  I have a lot of ideas planned for future biomes in this strange post-apocalyptic world.  I want this world to feel  fun to explore and discover!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/0ed345882bc62ddbbaa85a20b563b86c.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/0ed345882bc62ddbbaa85a20b563b86c.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/0ed345882bc62ddbbaa85a20b563b86c.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to make your shop appealing to the world's wanderers so they move into the area and bring more wealth to afford those big hitters you catch</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Town Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/921ea0f1849f437bf1a145c8266ab38e.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/921ea0f1849f437bf1a145c8266ab38e.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/921ea0f1849f437bf1a145c8266ab38e.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/302bdc56f1f248908a1a413f12df04e8.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/302bdc56f1f248908a1a413f12df04e8.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/302bdc56f1f248908a1a413f12df04e8.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you repair and upgrade your shop, others will begin settling into the area as well and begin building, I hope this will make it visually rewarding and exciting to see the area change over time!  You will unlock possible NPC's to interact with in the future here.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rebuilding &amp; Upgrading</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/5c2d521803c225c27032ffa487ec089c.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/5c2d521803c225c27032ffa487ec089c.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/5c2d521803c225c27032ffa487ec089c.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to make your shop appealing to the world's wanderers.  As you keep upgrading your store, you'll get more floor space and new props/technology to build your store with!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weather</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/1977cae14f48dcdcf396eed6ffdbdf62.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/1977cae14f48dcdcf396eed6ffdbdf62.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/1977cae14f48dcdcf396eed6ffdbdf62.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When rainy days happen, different fish become available that you can't find in clear weather!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/7e7581a890dabc65076417111b491313.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/7e7581a890dabc65076417111b491313.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/7e7581a890dabc65076417111b491313.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your decorations, furniture, and displays the way you want to!  I want to get a nice variety of content for you to make your store layouts interesting and unique.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Taxes - The Government</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/9d4f60b383bc1f8e76929f33564618a6.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/9d4f60b383bc1f8e76929f33564618a6.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/9d4f60b383bc1f8e76929f33564618a6.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even in the apocalypse you can't escape the tax man - The government will fly near your shop every few days to collect payment for helping you rebuild - They want their cut!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decorating</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > I want to actually reward players for decorating, instead of it just being purely for looks!  I haven't figured out exactly what 'decor' bonus will give yet, but I'll keep you posted.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dog</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/7cd315113c4ccd5d69150c24d2b6e3b2.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/7cd315113c4ccd5d69150c24d2b6e3b2.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/7cd315113c4ccd5d69150c24d2b6e3b2.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your dog fed and happy!  I want to make the dog mechanic more interesting in the future (Including maybe choosing a different starter pet).  It will be a fun little companion on your journey across this odd world.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Achievements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/966ef4e4b48190edfd7ced10954ff280.poster.avif?t=1770329380\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/966ef4e4b48190edfd7ced10954ff280.webm?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/extras/966ef4e4b48190edfd7ced10954ff280.mp4?t=1770329380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > I'd love to have a way for you to keep track of all the fish you've discovered, how many you've caught and the biggest weight you've caught!  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Catch fish, build your store, and sell your catches! Explore a mysterious world to find new areas, and new fish to catch. Decorate to get wealthier customers to buy your big catches. As you build up your store, a town will evolve around you!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Traditional Chinese, Finnish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/header.jpg?t=1770329380", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/9ad473c80c3aa2bfe0b4ecb86c2f5fcbf4231402/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770329380", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196270/9ad473c80c3aa2bfe0b4ecb86c2f5fcbf4231402/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770329380", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-3320M @ 2.60 GHz / AMD Ryzen 3 3200u<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon HD 5000+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1000 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-3320M @ 2.60 GHz / AMD Ryzen 3 3200u<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon HD 5000+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "developers": ["Sinqnew"], "publishers": ["Sinqnew"], "demos": [{"appid": 3814920, "description": ""